return {
    ["\n  \n精准报时，人人可享！\n清洁上油，只要六便士！\n发条更换，质优价廉！\n怀表估价，现金收购旧表！\n\n机不可失，铁十字街平价钟表行即将调价！\n速来锁定今日低价！"] = "\n\nPrecise timekeeping, available to everyone!\nCleaning and oiling, only 6 pence!\nMainspring replacement, high quality and low price!\nPocket watch appraisal, cash for old watches!\n\nDon't miss this opportunity, the Iron Cross Street affordable clock shop is about to adjust prices!\nCome quickly to lock in today's low prices!",
    ["  %s次内必出<Quality_6>危险等级1</>封印物"] = "Guaranteed <Quality_6> Danger Level 1 </> Sealed Artifact within %s pulls",
    ["\"奇迹师\"梅林-3星"] = "\"Miracle Invoker\" Merlin - 3 Star",
    ["84级12人本BOSS普通"] = "Level 84 12-Player Dungeon Boss Normal",
    ["<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">圣光净化</>获得分支技能<HighLight>圣焰焚净</>：\n净化范围内消散的敌方玩家，引发爆炸对存活目标造成伤害。分支技能拥有8秒冷却时间。"] = "<HyperLink stylename=\"M_Link\" u=\"86011050\" color=\"#f4a067\">Holy Light Purification</> gains the branch skill <HighLight>Holy Flame Cleansing</>: \nPurifies enemy players who dissipate within the range, triggering an explosion that deals damage to surviving targets. The branch skill has an 8-second Cooldown.",
    ["<P_Heart>松鼠语</>吱吱吱！醒来后……主人就躺在厨房里……已经……已经凉了……"] = "<P_Heart>Squirrel Language</> Squeak squeak squeak! After I woke up... the Master was lying in the kitchen... already... already cold...",
    ["<Title>势力预分配</>\n<Highlight>9月12日21:30—9月13日12:00</>，系统将统一进行一次势力预分配。\n\n<Title>势力调整</>\n<Highlight>9月13日12:00—9月13日18:00</>，各赛区筛选第1名俱乐部将被锁定，无法调整势力；其余俱乐部可手动调整己方势力。每个势力最多容纳<Highlight>4个俱乐部</>。截止18:00，仍未选择势力的俱乐部将由系统随机分配。\n\n<Title>势力对战</>\n9月13日18:00后，所有俱乐部势力将锁定。<Highlight>9月17日维护后</>将开启为期一个月的势力对战；对战期间势力不会变动，各俱乐部将代表所属势力角逐战略服荣耀。"] = "<Title>Faction Pre-allocation</>\n<Highlight>September 12, 21:30—September 13, 12:00</>, the system will perform a unified faction pre-allocation.\n\n<Title>Faction Adjustment</>\n<Highlight>September 13, 12:00—September 13, 18:00</>, the 1st place club in each division will be locked and cannot adjust their faction; other clubs can manually adjust their faction. Each faction can accommodate a maximum of <Highlight>4 clubs</>. By 18:00, clubs that have not yet chosen a faction will be randomly assigned by the system.\n\n<Title>Faction Battle</>\nAfter September 13, 18:00, all club factions will be locked.<Highlight>After the September 17 maintenance</>, a month-long Faction Battle will begin; factions will not change during the battle, and each club will represent its faction to compete for the glory of the strategic server.",
    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>俱乐部说明</>\n加入或创建俱乐部，可以参与各种俱乐部活动玩法，获取丰厚的活动奖励和同行纹章，同行纹章可在俱乐部商店中兑换奖励道具。\n俱乐部成员锁定规则：在以俱乐部为单位的玩法活动（如四方联赛、歌剧魅影、猎城战、高原战）期间，俱乐部不允许成员的加入和退出。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>创建响应俱乐部</>\n角色等级到达20级，可以选择加入俱乐部或自行创建俱乐部。\n创建俱乐部需要缴纳创建费用，创建后24小时内响应人数达到4人则创建成功，超时将创建失败。\n创建失败和主动取消创建，都不会返还创建费用。"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Club Instructions</>\nJoin or create a club to participate in various club activities, earn generous activity rewards and Peer Emblems. Peer Emblems can be exchanged for reward items in the Club Shop.\nClub Member Lock Rule: During club-based gameplay activities (such as the Four-Way League, Phantom of the Opera, Hunting City War, Plateau War), clubs are not allowed to add or remove members.\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>Creating/Responding to a Club</>\nOnce your character reaches level 20, you can choose to join a club or create one yourself.\nCreating a club requires a creation fee. If 4 people respond within 24 hours of creation, the creation is successful; otherwise, it will fail.\nNeither failed creation nor voluntary cancellation will refund the creation fee.",
